  "glitchDescription" : "Pleased. While the gameplay loop is shallow, I can't lie and say that eating your foes to get bigger isn't satisfying. 7.5/10.",
  "humanDescription" : "A game about eating people and monsters and getting fatter... \"The Developers' Poorly Disguised Vore Fetish\" might be a more fitting title.",
  "hylotlDescription" : "A simplistic maze game about eating monsters and people. Unsurprising that this came from a Floran studio.",
  "novakidDescription" : "So you run around a maze and eat monsters and other hunters to get bigger? Interesting...",

